{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c1a2b3d4-e5f6-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d",
    "name": "Sistem Nilai Zero Trust - Fase 2 & 3",
    "description": "Collection Postman untuk seluruh endpoint aktif.\n\nUrutan yang disarankan:\n1. Health Check\n2. Auth (login admin/dosen/mahasiswa, refresh, logout, service token)\n3. Nilai (GET, PUT draft, finalisasi)\n4. Transkrip (GET sendiri/admin/lain, sinkron service)\n5. Negative Cases\n\nToken disimpan otomatis sebagai collection variable setelah login berhasil.\nIsi variable service_client_secret dari .env sebelum menguji service token dan sinkronisasi.\n\nSetelah finalisasi, nilai kelas menjadi final. Reset database demo sebelum menjalankan ulang collection dari awal.\n\nService Nilai (3001) dan Service Transkrip (3002) tidak diekspos ke host; health check internal diuji dengan docker compose exec sesuai docs/API.md.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "description": "Endpoint health dan fallback gateway.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Gateway - GET /health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code 200', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Service adalah gateway', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.service).to.eql('gateway');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Phase phase-2-3', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.phase).to.eql('phase-2-3');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway_url}}/health",
            "description": "Health check gateway. Tidak memerlukan autentikasi."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Gateway - 404 Not Found",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code 404', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Error not_found', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('not_found');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway_url}}/tidak-ada",
            "description": "Verifikasi fallback 404."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
